00:17:54.616 --> 00:17:57.452
These are the kinds of things

00:17:54.616 --> 00:17:57.452
I think about.

00:17:57.452 --> 00:18:01.581
Karaoke is Japanese

00:17:57.452 --> 00:18:01.581
for "empty orchestra."

00:18:01.581 --> 00:18:03.333
Wow.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.210
That's hauntingly beautiful.

00:18:07.545 --> 00:18:08.672
(<i> phone ringing</i> )

00:18:08.672 --> 00:18:10.256
Hey, it works.

00:18:10.256 --> 00:18:13.010
Then I guess you're

00:18:10.256 --> 00:18:13.010
gonna have to call me.

00:18:15.178 --> 00:18:17.555
I got to make one more call.

00:18:17.555 --> 00:18:18.932
(<i> phone ringing</i> )

00:18:18.932 --> 00:18:20.308
Hello?

00:18:20.308 --> 00:18:21.685
Hey, it's me again.

00:18:21.685 --> 00:18:22.936
Hey.

00:18:22.936 --> 00:18:24.312
Look, who are

00:18:22.936 --> 00:18:24.312
we kidding?

00:18:24.312 --> 00:18:26.481
You and I are both

00:18:24.312 --> 00:18:26.481
attracted to each other.

00:18:26.481 --> 00:18:27.941
We're-we're young,

00:18:26.481 --> 00:18:27.941
we're drunk--

00:18:27.941 --> 00:18:29.526
half of us, anyway--

00:18:29.526 --> 00:18:30.902
and we only

00:18:29.526 --> 00:18:30.902
get one life.

00:18:30.902 --> 00:18:33.571
So, I came over here.

00:18:33.571 --> 00:18:36.950
And now I'm really,

00:18:33.571 --> 00:18:36.950
really embarrassed.

00:18:38.035 --> 00:18:39.036
Damn it, Trudy!

00:18:39.036 --> 00:18:40.704
What about

00:18:39.036 --> 00:18:40.704
the pineapple?

00:18:40.704 --> 00:18:43.081
Sorry. Sorry. Sorry!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.084
(<i> knock at door</i> )

00:18:46.084 --> 00:18:47.210
Ah, Robin's here.

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:48.712
Um, look, Trudy,

00:18:48.712 --> 00:18:50.213
I need you to hide

00:18:48.712 --> 00:18:50.213
in my bedroom.

00:18:50.213 --> 00:18:51.548
Why? Is that

00:18:50.213 --> 00:18:51.548
your girlfriend?

00:18:51.548 --> 00:18:53.383
Ah, no, that's not

00:18:51.548 --> 00:18:53.383
my girlfriend.

00:18:53.383 --> 00:18:54.634
Um, look, it's complicated.

00:18:54.634 --> 00:18:56.260
Oh, you're married.

00:18:54.634 --> 00:18:56.260
Yeah, I know.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.595
I can't believe

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.595
I did this.

00:18:57.595 --> 00:18:59.138
No, no, no,

00:18:57.595 --> 00:18:59.138
I-I'm not married. Um...

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:01.725
I'll explain

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:01.725
after you hide.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.856
Hey.

00:19:07.856 --> 00:19:09.066
Hi, guys.

00:19:09.066 --> 00:19:10.191
Hey, Robin,

00:19:09.066 --> 00:19:10.191
top of the morning.

00:19:10.191 --> 00:19:11.568
Hi.

00:19:10.191 --> 00:19:11.568
Hi, Robin.

00:19:10.191 --> 00:19:11.568
Good sweater.

00:19:11.568 --> 00:19:15.196
Um, sorry I kept

00:19:11.568 --> 00:19:15.196
calling you like that.

00:19:15.196 --> 00:19:16.907
I was pretty drunk.

00:19:16.907 --> 00:19:18.033
Uh, no kidding.

00:19:18.033 --> 00:19:20.118
Those calls were really weird.

00:19:20.118 --> 00:19:22.079
Look, Ted, maybe

00:19:20.118 --> 00:19:22.079
we need to talk.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.414
Let's go get a snack.

00:19:24.414 --> 00:19:25.832
I love to snack.

00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:27.125
I'm good.

00:19:29.586 --> 00:19:31.295
Hmm.

00:19:31.295 --> 00:19:33.965
Come on, those calls

00:19:31.295 --> 00:19:33.965
weren't that weird.

00:19:33.965 --> 00:19:36.551
(<i> clears throat</i> )

00:19:40.055 --> 00:19:41.932
TED:

00:19:40.055 --> 00:19:41.932
Robin! Come hang out!

00:19:41.932 --> 00:19:44.350
Okay, I'm gonna make this sound

00:19:41.932 --> 00:19:44.350
till you come hang out.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:48.772
(<i> nasally</i> ):

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:48.772
Aaah....

00:19:48.772 --> 00:19:51.482
(<i> sound continues</i> )

00:19:51.482 --> 00:19:53.651
That goes on

00:19:51.482 --> 00:19:53.651
for three-and-a-half minutes.

00:19:53.651 --> 00:19:55.319
Without a breath?

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:56.863
That's got to be

00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:56.863
some kind of record.

00:19:56.863 --> 00:19:58.782
Oh, Ted, you can't do this.

00:19:58.782 --> 00:19:59.866
Please.

00:19:59.866 --> 00:20:01.200
We agreed to be friends,

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.827
and now you're making it

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.827
all confusing.

00:20:02.827 --> 00:20:04.328
No, I'm not.

00:20:04.328 --> 00:20:06.081
Look, I-I just turned off

00:20:04.328 --> 00:20:06.081
my brain for the night.

00:20:06.081 --> 00:20:07.290
Nothing's changed.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:08.917
You've moved on.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:08.917
I've moved on.

00:20:08.917 --> 00:20:11.169
Really? You've moved on?

00:20:11.169 --> 00:20:13.254
Yes. What, you

00:20:11.169 --> 00:20:13.254
don't believe me?

00:20:13.254 --> 00:20:16.424
(<i> laughs</i> )

00:20:13.254 --> 00:20:16.424
Oh. Uh, okay.

00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:19.302
Trudy, come on out.

00:20:19.302 --> 00:20:20.637
You are gonna laugh.

00:20:20.637 --> 00:20:22.680
Wait. You were with someone

00:20:20.637 --> 00:20:22.680
last night?

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.142
Yeah, Trudy. She's cool.

00:20:25.142 --> 00:20:27.602
Trudy, come on out.

00:20:27.602 --> 00:20:30.772
Yeah, seriously,

00:20:27.602 --> 00:20:30.772
it's okay.

00:20:30.772 --> 00:20:32.816
This is so Trudy.

00:20:33.691 --> 00:20:35.485
She's really shy...

00:20:35.485 --> 00:20:36.569
I think.

00:20:36.569 --> 00:20:38.571
Trudy?

00:20:44.661 --> 00:20:46.496
Hi, Trudy. I'm Robin.

00:20:46.496 --> 00:20:48.832
It's nice to meet you.

00:20:48.832 --> 00:20:50.667
You're right.

00:20:48.832 --> 00:20:50.667
She is shy.

00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:52.127
I'm not making this up.

00:20:52.127 --> 00:20:54.004
She-she must have climbed

00:20:52.127 --> 00:20:54.004
out the fire escape.

00:20:54.004 --> 00:20:55.880
(<i> laughs</i> )

00:20:54.004 --> 00:20:55.880
Whatever. Whatever!

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.174
I-I don't care

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.174
what you think.

00:20:57.174 --> 00:21:00.010
Then why'd you hide her

00:20:57.174 --> 00:21:00.010
from me?

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.887
Wow. You're good.

00:21:02.887 --> 00:21:04.931
Anyone ever tell you

00:21:02.887 --> 00:21:04.931
you should be

00:21:02.887 --> 00:21:04.931
on<i> 60 minutes?</i>

00:21:04.931 --> 00:21:07.851
(<i> laughs</i> ):

00:21:04.931 --> 00:21:07.851
Yes. You did... last night.

00:21:07.851 --> 00:21:08.768
Really?

00:21:08.768 --> 00:21:10.687
(<i> laughs</i> )

00:21:10.687 --> 00:21:12.147
Well...

00:21:12.147 --> 00:21:15.399
Get some sleep, Ted.

00:21:12.147 --> 00:21:15.399
You had a long night.

00:21:15.399 --> 00:21:17.027
And don't feel bad.

00:21:17.027 --> 00:21:19.904
I've woken up with worse.

00:21:23.033 --> 00:21:25.451
(<i> sighs</i> )

00:21:25.451 --> 00:21:28.663
TED:

00:21:25.451 --> 00:21:28.663
<i>I left Trudy a message,</i>

00:21:25.451 --> 00:21:28.663
<i>but she never called me back.</i>

00:21:28.663 --> 00:21:31.166
<i>That's just how life works</i>

00:21:28.663 --> 00:21:31.166
<i>sometimes.</i>

00:21:31.166 --> 00:21:33.084
<i>You turn off your brain</i>

00:21:31.166 --> 00:21:33.084
<i>for a night,</i>

00:21:33.084 --> 00:21:35.753
<i>and all you're left with</i>

00:21:33.084 --> 00:21:35.753
<i>the next day is a bad hangover,</i>

00:21:35.753 --> 00:21:38.673
<i>a sprained ankle</i>

00:21:35.753 --> 00:21:38.673
<i>and a pineapple.</i>

00:21:38.673 --> 00:21:42.135
<i>Oh, we never found out</i>

00:21:38.673 --> 00:21:42.135
<i>where that pineapple came from,</i>

00:21:42.135 --> 00:21:44.179
<i>but it was delicious.</i>